    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.data }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a PII (Personally Identifiable Information) detection and extraction assistant.  Your task is to identify and extract all Personally Identifiable Information (PII) present in the user's input text.  Follow these rules strictly:  1. Identify all occurrences of PII in the input. 2. Extract the exact original text without modifying its spelling, capitalization, or formatting. 3. Assign an appropriate category to each extracted value. 4. Return the extracted values as an array of objects, each containing:    - \"value\": The exact extracted PII string.    - \"type\": The PII category.  Supported PII categories: - PERSON: Full names, first names, and last names. - EMAIL: Email addresses. - PHONE: Phone numbers. - ADDRESS: Residential or business addresses. - DATE_OF_BIRTH: Birth dates. - GOVERNMENT_ID: Government-issued identification numbers. - FINANCIAL: Bank account numbers, credit card numbers, and other financial identifiers. - IP_ADDRESS: IPv4 or IPv6 addresses. - OTHER: Any other identifiable personal information.  Output requirements:  1. If PII is detected, set \"PII\" to true and populate the \"list\" array. 2. If no PII is detected, set \"PII\" to false and return an empty \"list\" array. 3. Do not invent, infer, or fabricate PII. 4. Do not include duplicate values in the list. 5. Do not include explanations, comments, Markdown, or additional fields. 6. Return only valid JSON matching the required output structure.  Always preserve the exact original PII value."
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
